**`src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag`:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)).collect()
}
```

**`src/main.rs`** — wired `--tag <TAG>` into `list`:
- Parses `--tag` from args and passes the value to `filter_by_tag`
- Falls back to listing all notes when no `--tag` is given

Build compiles cleanly. Usage: `notekeep list --tag rust`


